## Lecture Hall Question {background="#FFD966" cols40x60 txtL="What is computer science?" capR="&quot;Computer science is no more about computers than astronomy is about telescopes.&quot; — Edsger W. Dijkstra" imgR="images/01a_Ueberblick/dijkstra.jpg"}

